<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan auctions 750 mln tenge T-bills May 26.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan auctions 750 mln tenge T-bills May 26.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 750 million tenge of six-month MKM discount Treasury bills on May 26, the National Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the six-month issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ46K2711971</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   750 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    182 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     May 26</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Nov 27, 1997</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
